==Description==
The '''Guitar''' is the first in-game musical instrument in Worlds Adrift. Once held in the player's hand, right click to begin playing. After right-clicking, the keys Q-R and A-F make different sounds. It is possible to play entire songs (so long as the tune is in E major). 
